{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":169.5,"mirrow":false,"y":-406,"img":"chara031_0","addImg":""},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":169.5,"mirrow":false,"y":-406,"img":"chara031_0","addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"波特温","text":"[show]哼……嘿——！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"波特温","text":"[show]哦，是你啊，刚刚在练习箭术，没注意到你的存在。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"波特温","text":"[show]这把弓是我从深渊外带进来的，是由专业的匠人打造的高贵武器，在深渊里不可能找到第二把。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"波特温","text":"[show]它不仅外观高压尊贵，硬度、弧度也比深渊最好的弓强上千倍万倍，这是我在深渊活动多年后得出来的结论。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"波特温","text":"[show]不过这也有一个问题，那就是如果我的弓坏了就很难修复。毕竟我也不太懂这种木工活……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"波特温","text":"[show]到时候说不定还得拜托你帮我修一修……咳，你什么都没听见，我什么都没说！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}],"des":"波特温-熟识3","script":"yd_031_06"}